        <article><![CDATA[<p>You need Doppel API credentials. Ask your Doppel contact for one of these sets:</p>
<ul><li><strong>Version 1 (API keys)</strong>: API key and user API key, plus the organisation code if your Doppel user belongs to more than one organisation.</li><li><strong>Version 2 (OAuth client credentials)</strong>: Client ID and Client secret.</li></ul>
<p>You need the <strong>x_doppe_doppel_t_0.admin</strong> role to configure the integration.</p>]]></article>
